{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new mission awaits you in this Mud and Thunder pack. A Resistance contact has gone missing following reports that Axis forces have invaded the region. It is now down to you to locate and save the contact to uncover their valuable intel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800250/extras/SER_DLC03_GIF_A_Campaign1.gif?t=1750165067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also included in this pack are the MAS 36, a reliable bolt action rifle which was designed to replace the French Berthier and Lebel rifles, and the Auto-5 shotgun, which was the first mass-produced semi-automatic shotgun on the market. Its mechanism provides a faster rate of fire compared to manually operated shotguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800250/extras/SER_DLC03_GIF_B_MAS36_NoText.gif?t=1750165067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, you will also receive the Golden Hex Weapon Skin which will give your firearms an opulent golden finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800250/extras/SER_DLC03_GIF_E_GoldenHex_NoText.gif?t=1750165067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mud and Thunder Pack includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tMud and Thunder Campaign Mission </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tMAS 36 Rifle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tAuto-5 Shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tGolden Hex Weapon Skin</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800250?t=1750165067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800250/c891cb14cec82cc7ba6c76441201849a41b6cfc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750165067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset